built with Rust's standard library (under the MIT licence or the Apache
License 2.0), with the {{len crates}} open-source crates listed first below,
and with the packages and fonts its window carries, listed after them.

Each licence's text follows the crates it covers. It's their own copy,
copyright notices included, from the crate's package or, where the package
lacks one, from the crate's source repository. Where none of the crates' own
files is recognised as the licence, its standard text stands in, and says so.
